(* fs-records-s2b A1 (record form), security result, (K_s, K_r, T_max) =
   (2, 3, 3): injective registration agreement in runs where Server objects
   also send later taskings, with adversary-chosen plaintexts, to the new
   peer before or after the Beacon finishes.  Every Beacon that finished
   registration with the pinned Server key is matched by its own, distinct
   Server build with the same identities, verified key tuple, assigned key
   ID, root, associated data and payload.  Also the target of the control
   C-NOGATE. *)
query obj: bitstring, s: bitstring, b: bitstring, init: beaconcrypt_core__pqxdh__t_VerifiedInitKex,
      kid: key_id, root: bitstring, ad: bitstring, p: bitstring;
  inj-event(FsBeaconEstablished(s, b, init, kid, root, ad, p))
  ==> inj-event(FsServerCommitted(obj, s, b, init, kid, root, ad, p)).

process FsRecordsS2bMain()
